   "xp": 180
  },
  {
   "copper": 40,
   "description": "At level 10, take the road to Copperfell Village and speak with Orrik Pineledger. Copperfell Foothills is level 11\u201320 country: this is a conversation handoff, not a demand to clear the whole road. Complete it with Orrik at the village.",
